/di/media/images/dw/20260413/1120314011150585856648379.jpeg/yU39n1ROpOxb2xWX3NlHD5xG9DfMYA5amomGxJqJhsQ\" alt=\"一栗小莎子（微博@一栗莎子）\"><figcaption>一栗小莎子（微博@一栗莎子）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260413/1120313998101712896756042.jpeg/u1NFgNmQ1gRaJgKs-eyDIPcHDkq0prK1AylFLQMpRS0\" alt=\"一栗小莎子（微博@一栗莎子）\"><figcaption>一栗小莎子（微博@一栗莎子）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260413/1120313980066336768085149.jpeg/FnwvNrau76FJQhpza0PdFLA80mnvS9DHvQG7Zr0Bu2Y\" alt=\"一栗小莎子（微博@一栗莎子）\"><figcaption>一栗小莎子（微博@一栗莎子）</figcaption></figure><p>延伸閱讀：</p><p>19歲女星腦梗塞中風！2度入院活動全喊卡　首出加護病房吐心聲</p><p>【本文獲「TVBS新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-20T16:05:24.726592+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":2079,"images":38,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}